<translation id="3667616615096815454">Ayikwazi ukufaka, uhlelo lokusebenza alwaziwa kuseva.</translation>
<translation id="3675854891107786059">Sebenzisa <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />umushwana wokungena <ph name="END_LINK" />ukuze ubhale ngokubethela idatha yeChrome kuGoogle Account yakho. Izindlela zokukhokha namakheli kusuka kuGoogle Pay ngeke kubethelwe. Umlando wokubhrawuza ovela kuChromium ngeke uvumelanise.</translation>
<translation id="7861068783030138988">{COUNT,plural, =0{Umlawuli wakho ucela ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Optimium ukuze kusetshenziswe lesi sibuyekezo}=1{Umlawuli wakho ucela ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Optimium ukuze kusetshenziswe lesi sibuyekezo. Iwindi lakho le-Incognito ngeke liphinde livuleke.}one{Umlawuli wakho ucela ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Optimium ukuze kusetshenziswe lesi sibuyekezo. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}other{Umlawuli wakho ucela ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Optimium ukuze kusetshenziswe lesi sibuyekezo. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}}</translation>
<translation id="8611928240945733486">Vula isixhumanisi ku&amp;thebhu elisha le-Optimium</translation>
<translation id="3728124580182886854">Linka i-Chromium namanye amasevisi e-Google ngokwenza ngokomuntu ngamunye nangezinye izinjongo</translation>
<translation id="3729187154190517324">Julisa usesho lwakho ngokufaka amathebhu amaningi, amafayela, namathuluzi usebenzisa inkinobho ethi "Faka ithebhu nokuningi".</translation>
<translation id="3032577647176321971">Phatha Amaphrofayela e-Optimium</translation>
<translation id="6314444399103340747">Funda ukuthi kungani i-Optimium ivimbela ukudawuniloda okuthile</translation>
<translation id="379589255253486813">I-Chromium izokwazisa uma kukhona okudinga isibuyekezo sakho</translation>
<translation id="3802055581630249637">I-Chromium ilayisha kusengaphambili amakhasi okungenzeka uwavakashele, ukuze alayishe ngokushesha lapho uwavakashela</translation>
<translation id="3810973564298564668">Phatha</translation>
<translation id="4301680230606686279">Ukuze usebenzise amaphasiwedi akho agciniwe, landela ikhodi ye-QR, dawuniloda iOptimium ye-iOS bese ungena ngemvume kuGoogle Account yakho</translation>
<translation id="3846683726093018685">**Fingqa:** Ngomusho owodwa onamagama angaphansi kwa-30, chaza abantu ebhekiswe kubo nenjongo eyinhloko yekhontenti yakho eku-screenshot.

          **Phakamisa Imibuzo:** Sungula uhlu lwamachashazi olunemibuzo emi-3 ukuya kwemi-5 eshukumisa ingqondo engase ibuzwe umsebenzisi ukuze asiqonde kahle i-screenshot. Le mibuzo kufanele ihlanganise okungenani owodwa okhuluma ngokuqondile ngento ebukwayo, indlela eklanywe ngayo, noma indawo ekuyo.</translation>
<translation id="3287167856630539345"><ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /> - Optimium</translation>
<translation id="3117512156333858342">Ukuze uthole amabhukhimakhi nokukumadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuOptimium</translation>
<translation id="3511883131632987404">{COUNT,plural, =1{Umlawuli wakho ucela uqalise kabusha iOptimium ukuze kusebenze okubuyekeziwe. Iwindi lakho Elizimele ngeke livuleke kabusha.}one{Umlawuli wakho ucela uqalise kabusha iOptimium ukuze kusebenze okubuyekeziwe. Amawindi akho Azimele angu-# ngeke avuleke kabusha.}other{Umlawuli wakho ucela uqalise kabusha iOptimium ukuze kusebenze okubuyekeziwe. Amawindi akho Azimele angu-# ngeke avuleke kabusha.}}</translation>
<translation id="3885770153807205175">Okokukhetha ulimi</translation>
<translation id="7294070483192043494">Yenza ngokwezifiso uphinde ulawule i-Optimium. Okuthile kudinga ukuthi ukunake - chofoza ngemininingwane.</translation>
<translation id="7920927747111819647">Chofoza igama lakho ukuze uvule i-Optimium uphinde uqale ukudlulisa amehlo.</translation>
<translation id="3892148308691398805">Kopisha umbhalo</translation>
<translation id="4454986649289930182">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usengene ngemvume kakade kule phrofayela ye-Optimium. Ukuze uqhubeke nokuphequlula ngokwehlukile, i-Optimium ingakwazi ukukudalela iphrofayela yakho.</translation>
<translation id="7225128703667880746">Lesi sandiso sephula inqubomgomo Yesitolo sewebu se-Chrome, futhi kungenzeka singabi esiphephile. Sisuse ku-Optimium ukuze singasakwazi ukubona nokushintsha idatha yakho kumasayithi owavakashelayo, okufaka phakathi ulwazi lwakho lomuntu siqu.</translation>
<translation id="3941890832296813527">Iphutha lokufaka: Igama lefayela lesifaki alivumelekile noma alisekelwe.</translation>
<translation id="6304622602441037994">I-Optimium izama ukukopisha amaphasiwedi. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="2274695480528598968">Ukuze uthole imininingwane oyigcinile nokukumadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuOptimium</translation>
<translation id="1713567483777335359">Amaphasiwedi akho, izindlela zokukhokha, namakheli owalondoloze kuGoogle Account yakho azosuswa kule divayisi. Ukuze uphinde uzisebenzise kuOptimium, ngena ngemvume futhi.</translation>
<translation id="395904275706073188">Amakhasi avikelwe awakwazi ukufundwa. Zama ikhasi elehlukile.</translation>
<translation id="3962647064319009959">Funda ukuthi i-Chromium ikugcina kanjani uphephile</translation>
<translation id="3967822245660637423">Ukulanda kuqedile</translation>
<translation id="3971865010372729242">Uma uthayipha kubha yekheli noma ebhokisini lokusesha, iChromium ithumela okuthayiphayo kusesho lwenhlangano yakho, i-AI, nakumathuluzi omenzeli ukuthola iziphakamiso.</translation>
<translation id="3975724895399328945">Mayelana ne-&amp;Google Chrome Yokuhlola</translation>
<translation id="3984557288004650913">Enkinobheni ethi "Google Search kuChrome" kubha yamathuluzi, ungavula kabusha iGoogle Search kuChrome ukuze ubuze imibuzo ngenkathi ubhrawuza</translation>
<translation id="3997429360543082038">Mayelana ne-ChromiumOS</translation>
<translation id="4016217212818346953">Hlala uphephile Ngesiphathi Sephasiwedi</translation>
<translation id="4019629340646866719">I-ChromiumOS yenziwe ukuthi isebenze ngesofthiwe yomthombo ovulekile owengeziwe<ph name="BEGIN_LINK_CROS_OSS" />isofthiwe yomthombo ovulekile<ph name="END_LINK_CROS_OSS" />, njengoba kunjalo ngendawo yokuthuthukiswa kwe-<ph name="BEGIN_LINK_LINUX_OSS" />Linux<ph name="END_LINK_LINUX_OSS" />.</translation>
<translation id="4022972681110646219">Isikrini sokuhumusha</translation>
<translation id="4023601594785368013">Ulimi loqobo: <ph name="LANGUAGE" /></translation>
<translation id="8098054594752731054">Vula amalinki kuOptimium kunoma iyiphi i-app. Futhi ukuze ifinyeleleke kalula, iphinwa ku-taskbar yakho.</translation>
<translation id="4036079820698952681">Siza i-Chromium ibengcono ngokubika <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />izilungiselelo zamanje<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="4050175100176540509">Ukuthuthukiswa kokuphepha okubalulekile nezici ezintsha kuyathokala kunguqulo yakamuva.</translation>
<translation id="4055805654398742145">Umphathi Wephasiwedi</translation>
<translation id="3150466418323356831">{COUNT,plural, =1{Inhlangano yakho ivala i-Optimium ngokuzenzekelayo uma ingasetshenziswanga umzuzu o-1. Idatha yokubhrawuza isuliwe. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando, ukugcwalisa ngokuzenzakalelayo, nokudawuniloda.}one{Inhlangano yakho ivala i-Optimium ngokuzenzekelayo uma ingasetshenziswanga imizuzu engu-#. Idatha yokubhrawuza isuliwe. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando, ukugcwalisa ngokuzenzakalelayo, nokudawuniloda.}other{Inhlangano yakho ivala i-Optimium ngokuzenzekelayo uma ingasetshenziswanga imizuzu engu-#. Idatha yokubhrawuza isuliwe. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando, ukugcwalisa ngokuzenzakalelayo, nokudawuniloda.}}</translation>
