<translation id="113287843321846936"><ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /> - Inethiwekhi Yokungena ngemvume - i-Optimium</translation>
<translation id="101945827160630872">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usengenile ngemvume. Ukuze ugcine ukubhrawuza kwakho kuhlukile, ngena ngemvume kuOptimium kuphrofayela yakho njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /> Uzophinde uthole uhlu lwakho lokufunda nokuningi kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho.</translation>
<translation id="5914158797921975103">Thola izinhlelo zokusebenza ezinhle, amageyimu, izandiso, namatimu we-Optimium.</translation>
<translation id="7188357620681202939">Ukuze uthole lesi sandiso nokuningi kuwo wonke amakhompyutha wakho, ngena ngemvume kuOptimium</translation>
<translation id="1889725122457669356">Ukuze uhlale uphephile ku-inthanethi ngokukhetha komzali wakho, shintshela kuphrofayela yakho yeOptimium lapho usungene ngemvume kakade njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /></translation>
<translation id="4222932583846282852">Iyakhansela...</translation>
<translation id="4224210481850767180">Ukufaka kukhanseliwe.</translation>
<translation id="3467085712950617325">Xhumanisa idatha yakho ye-Optimium kule akhawunti?</translation>
<translation id="4251772536351901305">Ikuxwayisa mayelana namasayithi ayingozi, ngisho nalawo i-Google ebingazi ngawo ngaphambili, ngokuhlaziya idatha eningi evela kumasayithi kunokuvikela okujwayelekile. Ungakhetha ukweqa izixwayiso ze-Chromium.</translation>
<translation id="2140865310399147834">Phuma Ngemvume ku-Optimium</translation>
<translation id="4271805377592243930">Thola usizo nge-Chromium</translation>
<translation id="4275788652681621337">Khetha iphaneli yohlangothi</translation>
<translation id="4281844954008187215">Imigomo yesevisi</translation>
<translation id="3179093133057739293">Ukufaka kuhlulekile ngenxa yephutha elingacacisiwe. Uma ngabe i-Optimium iyasebenza manje, sicela uyivale uphinde uzame futhi.</translation>
