<translation id="3030627244449672752">Ungena ngemvume nge-akhawunti ephethwe futhi unikeza umlawuli wayo ukulawula okungaphezulu kwephrofayela yakho ye-Optimium. Idatha yakho ye-Optimium, efana nezinhlelo zakho zokusebenza, amabhukhimakhi, umlando, amaphasiwedi, nezinye izilungiselelo zizoboshezelwa unaphakade ku-<ph name="USER_NAME" />. Uzokwazi ukususa le datha nge-Ideshibhodi yama-Akhawunti we-Google, kodwa ngeke uze ukwazi ukuhlobanisa le datha nenye i-akhawunti. <ph name="LEARN_MORE" /></translation>
