<translation id="2024205307959964945">Ukuvikeleka, iOptimium ivala ukulungiselela kweJavaScript uma uvakashela isayithi okokuqala ngqa.

Uma leli khasi lingasebenzi njengoba kulindelekile, zama ukuvumela ukulungiselela.</translation>
