<translation id="8019243097022864687">Ukuze uthole izibuyekezo zeOptimium zesikhathi esizayo, uzodinga iWindows 10 uhlobo 1809 noma lwakamuva. Le khompyutha isebenzisa uhlobo oludala lweWindows 10.</translation>
