<translation id="569897634095159764">Ayikwazi ukuxhuma ku-inthanethi Iseva elibamba idinga ukufakazela ubuqiniso.</translation>
<translation id="5768371961535086509">IChromium ikhulula inkumbulo kumathebhu angasebenzi. Lokhu kunikeza amathebhu asebenzayo namanye ama-app izinsiza zekhompyutha ezengeziwe futhi kugcina iChromium ishesha. Amathebhu akho angasebenzi aphinde asebenze ngokuzenzekela uma ubuyela kuwo. <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />Funda kabanzi mayelana Nesilondolozi Senkumbulo<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="7953122114569280985">Uma ukhohlwa umushwana wakho wokungena noma ufuna ukushintsha le sethingi, <ph name="SETTINGS_LINK" /> idatha yeOptimium ku-akhawunti yakho</translation>
<translation id="174898372403396774">Yenza ngokwezifiso uphinde ulawule i-Optimium. Setha i-Optimium njengokwakho okuzenzakalelayo.</translation>
<translation id="7513745843649038539">Gcina amaphasiwedi wakho, amabhukhimakhi, nomlando kuvunyelaniswe ngokuphelele kuwo wonke amadivayisi ngokusetha iOptimium njengebhrawuza yakho ezenzakalelayo.</translation>
<translation id="5809516625706423866">Ayikwazi ukuxhuma ku-inthanethi I-HTTP 401 Ayigunyaziwe. Sicela uchekhe ukulungiselelwa kommeleli wakho.</translation>
<translation id="579643040945073674">Isheshisa amasayithi ngenjini yeOptimium V8 kodwa yenza iOptimium imelane kancane nokuhlaselwa. Le sethingi livaliwe.</translation>
