<translation id="2722851476153659127">I-Optimium izovala maduzane futhi isule idatha</translation>
<translation id="6855625092121599072">Ungashintsha phakathi kwamaphrofayela we-Optimium lapha</translation>
<translation id="615103374448673771">Uma uvumela amakhukhi, i-Chromium ingase iwasebenzise lapho ilayisha kusengaphambili</translation>
<translation id="6165508094623778733">Funda kabanzi</translation>
<translation id="440816316079905155">Sula idatha yeOptimium e-akhawuntini yakho</translation>
<translation id="8018999409456045233">Leli fayela kungenzeka libe nobungozi<ph name="LINE_BREAK" />I-Optimium ingakuhlolela lokhu okudawunilodwayo uma unikeza iphasiwedi. Ulwazi mayelana nefayela luthunyelwa kokuthi Ukuphequlula ngokuphephile kwe-Google, kodwa okuqukethwe kufayela kanye nephasiwedi kusala kudivayisi yakho.</translation>
<translation id="6182736845697986886">Ukufaka kuhlulekile ngenxa yephutha langaphakathi leseva yokubuyekeza.</translation>
<translation id="3469021117852380318">Yenza isiqinisekiso sokuthi ungene ngemvume ku-Optimium ku-<ph name="TARGET_DEVICE_NAME" /> yakho bese uzama ukuthumela futhi.</translation>
<translation id="2986761964667678689">Sesha futhi ubuze imibuzo noma yikuphi, ngisho noma iOptimium incishisiwe. Ivumela iOptimium ukuthi isebenze ngemuva.</translation>
<translation id="1244028666242035366">Le khompyutha isivele inenguqulo yakamuva kakhulu ye-Optimium. Uma isofthiwe ingasebenzi, sicela ukhiphe i-Optimium uphinde uzame futhi.</translation>
<translation id="6513480350636703580">{0,plural, =0{I-Optimium izoqalisa kabusha manje}=1{I-Optimium izoqalisa kabusha kusekhondi elingu-1}one{I-Optimium izoqalisa kabusha kumasekhondi angu-#}other{I-Optimium izoqalisa kabusha kumasekhondi angu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="3859762680410498178">IOptimium izobuyekeza uma isikrini sakho singasetshenziswa</translation>
<translation id="18853993527252772">I-Optimium idinga imvume yokufinyelela kusitoreji ukuze idawunilode amafayela</translation>
<translation id="6245734527075554892">Kuhlola ama-URL anohlu lwamasayithi angaphephile agcinwe ku-Chromium</translation>
<translation id="571621467627269416">Yenza i-Optimium ibe yisiphequluli esizenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="6248988683584659830">Izilungiselelo zosesho</translation>
<translation id="4260906300317983841">Thola izakhi zokuphepha ezihamba phambili zeGoogle usendleleni, nge-app yeOptimium efonini yakho</translation>
<translation id="6919871734111021049">Phuma ku-Optimium?</translation>
<translation id="8269500201917700071">Lawa mathebhu asebenzisa izinsiza ezengeziwe. Ukuze uthuthukise ukusebenza kwakho, vumela iOptimium iwenze angasebenzi.</translation>
<translation id="2906910751900335741">Yenza ngokwezifiso iphrofayela yakho ye-Optimium</translation>
<translation id="6290827346642914212">Qama iphrofayela lakho le-Chromium</translation>
<translation id="6294638840436017818">Enkinobheni ethi "Iphaneli eseceleni yeGoogle Search" kubha yamathuluzi, ungavula kabusha iphaneli eseceleni yeGoogle Search ukuze ubuze imibuzo ngenkathi ubhrawuza</translation>
<translation id="6612045300479871672">Isandiso sifuna ukuthi ungene kuOptimium</translation>
<translation id="2723016125417495514">I-<ph name="FILE_NAME" /> kungenzeka ibe ingozi, ngakho-ke i-Optimium iyivimbile.</translation>
<translation id="6308106880471005841">Inkinobho ethi "Iphaneli yeGoogle Search" kubha yamathuluzi inesithonjana esisha. Yichofoze ukuze ubuze imibuzo njengoba ubhrawuza ngephaneli yeGoogle Search.</translation>
<translation id="6151952148243982653">I-Optimium isebenzisa ikhamela yakho.</translation>
<translation id="7744220780291650493">Okunye ukusebenza ku-Optimium kuyaqhubeka. Sicela uzame futhi emuva kwesikhathi.</translation>
<translation id="4212271170228408978">Manje kulula ukusebenzisa i-Optimium nge-Akhawunti yakho ye-Google nakumakhompyutha abiwe.</translation>
<translation id="7560359899505953564">Thola ukufinyelela okulula ezakhini ozaziyo, ozithandayo, futhi ozethembayo ngokusetha iOptimium njengebhrawuza yakho evuleka ngokuzenzakalelayo.</translation>
<translation id="9090225774559341003">Isinqamuleli se-Optimium</translation>
<translation id="6926580396655648750">I-Optimium ivimbele lokhu kudawunilodwa ngoba ifayela alivamile ukudawunilodwa futhi lingase libe yingozi</translation>
<translation id="8406846117825568223">Ingabe uqinisekile ukuthi ufuna ukukhipha i-Optimium?</translation>
<translation id="6375219077595103062">Engeza isinqamuleli Kusiphathi Sephasiwedi</translation>
<translation id="6388799252195623474">ngisize ngalokhu</translation>
<translation id="9091694200019721003">Ukuze uqhubeke, ngena ngemvume kuOptimium njengo-<ph name="EMAIL" />. Lokhu kuqinisekisa ukuthi unezinqubomgomo zenhlangano yakho.</translation>
<translation id="3942952894185574182">Ilogo ye-Optimium ngaphakathi kwesikrini sekhompyutha.</translation>
<translation id="3353682461772532321">I-Optimium yisiphequluli sewebhu esiqalisa amakhasi wewebhu nezinhlelo zokusebenza ngesivinini sombani. Iyashesha, izinzile, futhi isebenziseka kalula. Dlulisa amehlo kuwebhu ngokuvikeleke kakhulu ngokuvikelwa kuhlelo olungayilungele ikhompyutha nobugebengu bokweba imininingwane ebucayi eyakhelwe ku-Optimium.</translation>
<translation id="6791461984478543248">Ukuze uqinisekise ukuthi ungakwazi njalo ukusebenzisa futhi ulondoloze idatha yeOptimium kuGoogle Account yakho, qinisekisa ukuthi nguwe</translation>
<translation id="6174985388495951106">IOptimium iyashesha ukuqalisa futhi izakhi ezisebenzisa iJavaScript kufanele zisebenze ngendlela eziklanywe ngayo</translation>
<translation id="6436260184216827876">Usesho Lomfanekiso alutholakali. Zama futhi kamuva.</translation>
<translation id="6442900851116057561">Qalisa kabusha i-ChromiumOS</translation>
<translation id="6443470774889161065">I-Chromium ilayisha kusengaphambili amakhasi engeziwe ongase uwavakashele, ukuze alayishe ngokushesha kakhudlwana lapho uwavakashela</translation>
<translation id="2102210363398612557">Dawuniloda iOptimium efonini yakho ukuze ulandelele izintengo futhi uthole izexwayiso uma intengo yehla kunoma yiliphi isayithi</translation>
<translation id="6598227122144472874">Kuvaliwe • I-Optimium ayikwazi ukuqinisekisa ukuthi lesi sandiso sivela kuphi</translation>
<translation id="3895850825918446737">Siyakwamukela kumaphrofayela we-Optimium</translation>
<translation id="3239105679122868308">Ngokuzayo uma uvula iOptimium ku-<ph name="DEVICE_TYPE" /> yakho, uzobona umyalelo wokusebenzisa amaqembu amathebhu.</translation>
<translation id="5440394152628202500">Susa I-akhawunti kuOptimium</translation>
<translation id="5673289019038024720">Iphinde ilawule ukuthi iliphi ikhasi eliboniswa lapho uqala i-Optimium.</translation>
<translation id="648319183876919572">Ukubhrawuza Ngokuphepha Okugqamile kwenza okuningi ukukuvikela kumawebhusayithi ayingozi nakokudawunilodiwe</translation>
<translation id="3922692586556595624">Khipha i-Optimium</translation>
<translation id="5977471146123132488">Izinqamuleli zivulwe ku-Optimium</translation>
<translation id="1873460655129342919">Inhlangano yakho ivala i-Optimium uma ingasetshenziswa isikhathi esingu-<ph name="TIMEOUT_DURATION" />. Idatha yokubhrawuza isuliwe. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando, ukugcwalisa ngokuzenzakalelayo, nokudawuniloda.</translation>
<translation id="139284349466910875">Iphrofayela ngalinye linolwazi lwalo lwe-Optimium njengamabhukhimakhi, umlando, amaphasiwedi, nokuningi</translation>
<translation id="6556755379298048869">Sesha ngesinqamuleli sekhibhodi.</translation>
<translation id="6563921047760808519">Funda kabanzi mayelana <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />nokuthi i-Chromium igcina kanjani idatha yakho iyimfihlo<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="562266251854740285">Izinguquko kule sethingi zizosetshenziswa uma iOptimium iqala kabusha.</translation>
<translation id="965740992595240282">Lawula izandiso zakho ngokuchofoza Izandiso kumenyu eyinhloko yeOptimium.</translation>
<translation id="2549448919385330625">Ungashintsha ukuze ubone amaphasiwedi kusuka kwenye iphrofayela ye-Optimium</translation>
<translation id="2662027419736610653">Sebenzisa i-app yeOptimium ukuze usebenzise amathuluzi e-AI ahamba phambili usendleleni</translation>
<translation id="6570579332384693436">Ukuze kulungiswe amaphutha okupeletwa, i-Chromium ithumela umbhalo owuthayiphayo kuzinkambu zombhalo ku-Google</translation>
<translation id="8346408025829878332">Iya kuzilungiselelo zesaziso se-Optimium</translation>
<translation id="6600016381025017075">Sesha noma yini kuleli khasi</translation>
<translation id="5149981246269331326">Izinguquko zakho zizosebenza ngesikhathi esilandelayo uma uqalisa kabusha i-Optimium.</translation>
<translation id="1163143914216098175">IOptimium manje iqala ukusebenza lapho iWindows iqala ukuze uqale ukubhrawuza ngokushesha. Ungavala lokhu kumasethingi.</translation>
<translation id="7839895033810030903">Qhubeka lapho ogcine khona: IOptimium ibuyisele amathebhu esikhathi esedlule Ungakuvala lokhu ku-</translation>
<translation id="8919724422686713691">I-Optimium idinga imvume yekhamera ukudala imephu ye-3D yendawo yakho ekuzungezile</translation>
<translation id="6669284030132180248">Uma futhi ulondoloza amabhukhimakhi ku-Google Account yakho, ungakwazi ukulandelela izintengo zomkhiqizo ku-Chromium futhi waziswe uma intengo yehla.</translation>
<translation id="6676384891291319759">Finyelela i-inthanethi?</translation>
<translation id="668175097507315160">I-ChromiumOS ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho yenxa yephutha lokungena ngemvume.</translation>
<translation id="2337492685922399200">Susa idatha yale app kusukela kuOptimium</translation>
<translation id="7200198227335381561">I-Optimium idinga imvume yemakrofoni kule sayithi</translation>
<translation id="6712881677154121168">Iphutha lokudawuniloda: <ph name="DOWNLOAD_ERROR" />.</translation>
<translation id="358599119501177356">Iphrofayela yakho ayikwazi ukusetshenziswa ngoba isuka kunguqulo entsha ye-Optimium.

Ezinye izici kungenzeka zingatholakali. Sicela ucacise umkhombandlela wephrofayela ehlukile noma usebenzise inguqulo entsha ye-Optimium.</translation>
<translation id="6729124504294600478">Ukuze uthole ukwenza ngokomuntu ngamunye nezinye izakhi, ezifaka i-Chromium Kumsebenzi wewebhu nowe-app nakumasevisi alinkiwe e-Google</translation>
<translation id="196085196242095682">I-Optimium isivele ifakiwe kubo bonke abasebenzisi kukhompuyutha yakho.</translation>
<translation id="8573534493546068455">Ukuze uthole amabhukhimakhi nokuningi kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuOptimium. Le bhokhimakhi izolondolozwa kuGoogle Account yakho ngemva kokungena ngemvume.</translation>
<translation id="674891594898436429">Chitha usesho olusebenzayo kule thebhu</translation>
<translation id="87486021868820245">Isheshisa amasayithi ngenjini yeOptimium V8 kodwa yenza iOptimium imelane kancane nokuhlaselwa. Le sethingi livuliwe.</translation>
<translation id="474617559993879524">{count,plural, =1{Enye idatha yakho yeOptimium ayikalondolozwa kuGoogle Account yakho njengamanje. Zama ukulinda imizuzu embalwa ngaphambi kokuphuma ngemvume. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha (into e-1) izosulwa.}one{Enye idatha yakho yeOptimium ayikalondolozwa kuGoogle Account yakho njengamanje. Zama ukulinda imizuzu embalwa ngaphambi kokuphuma ngemvume. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha (izinto ezingu-{count}) izosulwa.}other{Enye idatha yakho yeOptimium ayikalondolozwa kuGoogle Account yakho njengamanje. Zama ukulinda imizuzu embalwa ngaphambi kokuphuma ngemvume. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha (izinto ezingu-{count}) izosulwa.}}</translation>
<translation id="1681402107856523620">I-Optimium incoma ukuthi uskene leli fayela ngenxa yokuthi kungenzeka ukuthi liyingozi.</translation>
<translation id="6779406956731413166">I-ChromiumOS yenziwa yenzeke yi-<ph name="BEGIN_LINK_CROS_OSS" />isofthiwe yomthombo ovulekile<ph name="END_LINK_CROS_OSS" /> engeziwe.</translation>
<translation id="6804256634866838775">Chitha usesho olusebenzayo</translation>
<translation id="6831043979455480757">Humusha</translation>
<translation id="2199057756312069531">I-Optimium ikuvumela kuthi wazi amaphasiwedi akho afakwe engcupheni</translation>
<translation id="684888714667046800">Ayikwazi ukuxhuma ku-inthanethi. Uma usebenzisa uhlelo lokuvikela, sicela uqinisekise ukuthi i-<ph name="PRODUCT_EXE_NAME" /> ikuhlelo lwabagunyaziwe.</translation>
<translation id="6664374380152979637">I-Optimium - <ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /></translation>
<translation id="6859580922007887573">Ithebhu yokuqhubeka</translation>
<translation id="6862030660799253820">Sesha lesi sithombe ngesakhi esithi Ukusesha Ngezithombe</translation>
<translation id="6869568587896659271">Ukufinyelela okulula kumawebhusayithi angezansi kwebha yekheli</translation>
<translation id="4548192511713002443">I-Optimium ithole ukuthi i-"<ph name="EXTENSION_NAME" />" inohlelo olungayilungele ikhompyutha</translation>
<translation id="6877155553248388166">ikhona elingezansi ngakwesokudla lendawo yokusesha: ngakwesokudla okungu-<ph name="RIGHT" />%, ngezansi okungu-<ph name="BOTTOM" />%</translation>
<translation id="6896758677409633944">Kopisha</translation>
<translation id="6898028264630240901">Ungaphina Imisebenzi Engokomongo ukuze ubuze imibuzo kalula njengoba ubhrawuza</translation>
<translation id="3594007018780395447">Setha iOptimium njengebhrawuza evuleka ngokuzenzekela yakho uphinde uyiphine ku-taskbar yakho</translation>
<translation id="8874878391047306490">&amp;Lawula amaphrofayela eOptimium</translation>
<translation id="8227361644719983591">Lesi senzo sizokwenza lokhu:
          <ph name="LINE_BREAKS" />
            • Setha kabusha ikhasi lakho lokuqalisa, ikhasi lethebhu entsha, injini yokusesha namathebhu aphiniwe
            <ph name="LINE_BREAK" />
            • Vala izandiso
            <ph name="LINE_BREAK" />
            • Sula amakhukhi nenye idatha yesikhashana yesayithi
            <ph name="LINE_BREAK" />
            • Setha kabusha izinqamuleli zeOptimium
            <ph name="LINE_BREAKS" />
            Amabhukhimakhi, umlando, namaphasiwedi alondoloziwe ngeke aze athinteke.</translation>
<translation id="6926772305569367352">Inkinobho ethi "Google Search kuChrome" kubha yamathuluzi inesithonjana esisha. Yichofoze ukuze ubuze imibuzo njengoba ubhrawuza ngeGoogle Search kuChrome.</translation>
<translation id="7079691767892495301">Ufinyelele umkhawulo weOptimium wamabhukhimakhi angu-<ph name="BOOKMARK_LIMIT" />, ngakho amanye amabhukhimakhi akho awakalondolozwa kuGoogle Account yakho okwamanje.

Amabhukhimakhi amasha awakwazi ukulondolozwa e-akhawuntini yakho uze usule amanye. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, amabhukhimakhi angalondoloziwe azosulwa.</translation>
<translation id="8488478146459741524">Vula isixhumanisi kuwindi le-Optimium inco&amp;gnito</translation>
<translation id="6965382102122355670">KULUNGILE</translation>
<translation id="6985329841647292029">Imigomo ye-ChromiumOS</translation>
<translation id="8559464220428426642">Bhala umushwana wokungena ozowusebenzisa futhi ulondoloze idatha yeOptimium ku-akhawunti yakho, <ph name="ACCOUNT_EMAIL" /></translation>
<translation id="7011190694940573312">Ukufakwa kwehlulekile ngenxa yokuthi lolu hlobo lwesistimu yokusebenza alusekelwe.</translation>
<translation id="7024536598735240744">Iphutha lokuvula: <ph name="UNPACK_ERROR" />.</translation>
<translation id="7941779569092758272">{COUNT,plural, =1{Ukuvikelwa Okuthuthukile kudinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha iOptimium ukuze usebenzise isibuyekezo. Iwindi lakho Elizimele ngeke livuleke kabusha.}one{Ukuvikelwa Okuthuthukile kudinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha iOptimium ukuze usebenzise isibuyekezo. Amawindi akho Azimele angu-# ngeke avuleke kabusha.}other{Ukuvikelwa Okuthuthukile kudinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha iOptimium ukuze usebenzise isibuyekezo. Amawindi akho Azimele angu-# ngeke avuleke kabusha.}}</translation>
<translation id="5367778139372857256">Yenza i-Optimium Ibe Ngeyakho</translation>
<translation id="7047386856539490735">Ingabe ibe wusizo le miphumela?</translation>
<translation id="6654931874608808546">Buyekeza i-Optimium</translation>
<translation id="1078205929937913964">Uma isithombe singanayo incazelo ephelele, i-Optimium izozama ukukunikezela eyodwa. Ukuze udale izincazelo, izithombe zithunyelwa ku-Google.</translation>
<translation id="8657336023716174215">Thola amandla e-AI uma usebenzisa i-app yeOptimium ku-<ph name="DEVICE_TYPE" /> yakho</translation>
<translation id="8360922610978196377">Thatha amaphasiwedi akho, amathebhu nokuningi usendleleni nge-app yeOptimium efonini yakho</translation>
<translation id="7141270731789036260">Yenza i-Chrome ibe ngokwezifiso ukuze ihlolwe</translation>
<translation id="7147227333672430807">Ungasebenzisa iChromium noma nini lapho uchofoza amalinki emiyalezweni, amadokhumenti, namanye ama-app</translation>
<translation id="7635847276859447848">Susa <ph name="EXTENSION_NAME" /> kuOptimium</translation>
<translation id="4634249408802713112">Inhlangano yakho isula idatha ye-Optimium uma ingasetshenziswa isikhathi esingu-<ph name="TIMEOUT_DURATION" />. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando, ukugcwalisa ngokuzenzakalelayo, nokudawuniloda.</translation>
<translation id="3308314751977712481">I-Optimium idinga imvume yekhamera kule sayithi</translation>
<translation id="1700107811881467396">Ayikwazanga ukuqalisa i-Optimium. Zama futhi.</translation>
<translation id="615859695332174696">Buza noma yini, lapho ukhona, ngeGemini kuOptimium</translation>
<translation id="4082322885657154457">Gcina iOptimium Edokhini yakho ukuze ufike kuyo ngokushesha noma nini</translation>
<translation id="5886985791575399945">Sebenzisa i-Optimium noma nini lapho uchofoza amalinki emiyalezweni, kumadokhumenti, nakwamanye ama-app</translation>
<translation id="7213435258745128111">IGoogle Search kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="7216228761061470870">Uma usebenzisa Usesho Lomfanekiso kudeskithophu, isihloko sekhasi, i-URL, nekhontenti, okuhlanganisa ama-PDF, kuthunyelwa kuseva</translation>
<translation id="3899250150715276784">Isiphathi somsebenzi - I-Optimium</translation>
<translation id="357779301278973973">Buza mayelana nekhontenti ngaphandle kweOptimium, njengamanye ama-app noma amafayela</translation>
<translation id="2192941957286691074">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usevele ungene ngemvume. Ukuze ugcine ukubhrawuza kwakho kuhlukile, ngena ngemvume kuOptimium kuphrofayela yakho njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /> Uzothola nemininingwane yakho elondoloziwe nokuningi kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho.</translation>
<translation id="4695009148423764441">Qala ukubhrawuza ngokushesha: IOptimium manje ingaqala lapho iWindows iqala.</translation>
<translation id="7274695763216404502">Kuphiniwe! Sebenzisa Usesho Lomfanekiso futhi kubha yamathuluzi</translation>
<translation id="7288567540154601580">Amathebhu nezandiso</translation>
<translation id="7290997427370476749">Enkinobheni ethi "Iphaneli yeGoogle Search" kubha yamathuluzi, ungavula kabusha iphaneli yeGoogle Search ukuze ubuze imibuzo ngenkathi ubhrawuza</translation>
<translation id="1079602886106438527">{NUM_EXTENSIONS,plural, =1{I-Optimium incoma ukuthi usisuse}one{I-Optimium incoma ukuthi uzisuse}other{I-Optimium incoma ukuthi uzisuse}}</translation>
<translation id="5279936464959604532">Ukuze wabelane ngomsindo wohlelo, vula Amasethingi Ohlelo bese uvumela okuthi 'Ukurekhodwa Komsindo Wohlelo Kuphela' kuOptimium. Ngemva kwalokho kuzodingeka uqale kabusha iOptimium.</translation>
<translation id="7299899569525778554">Sesha kudeskithophu</translation>
<translation id="731795002583552498">Ibuyekeza i-Chromium</translation>
<translation id="1032861344046520617">Ifayela lakho lokuncamelayo limoshakele noma alivumelekile.

I-Optimium ayikwazi ukubuyisela izilungiselelo zakho.</translation>
<translation id="7324051657739063017">Ungavula kabusha Imisebenzi Engokomongo ukuze ubuze imibuzo ngesikhathi ubhrawuza</translation>
<translation id="265884122223707624">Iwebhu yakho, amabhukhimakhi, nezinye izinto ze-Optimium zihlala lapha.</translation>
<translation id="7347827960336370838">Ngumuntu onomushwana wakho wokungena kuphela ongafunda idatha yakho ebetheliwe. Umshwana wokungena awuthunyelwa noma ulondolozwe yiGoogle. Uma ukhohlwa umushwana wakho wokungena noma ufuna ukushintsha le sethingi <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />susa idatha yeChromium ku-akhawunti yakho<ph name="END_LINK" />.</translation>
<translation id="3014807377884544255">Umlawuli wakho wesistimu ulungiselele i-Optimium ukuthi ivule i-<ph name="ALTERNATIVE_BROWSER_NAME" /> ukuze ifinyelele ku-<ph name="TARGET_URL_HOSTNAME" />.</translation>
<translation id="7352651011704765696">Okuthile akuhambanga kahle</translation>
<translation id="6261059974673858354">Ukuze uthole izibuyekezo ezizayo zeOptimium, uzodinga imacOS 13 noma eyakamuva. Le khompyutha isebenzisa imacOS 12.</translation>
<translation id="7374061268215476070">Ungavula kabusha iphaneli eseceleni yeGoogle Search ukuze ubuze imibuzo ngenkathi ubhrawuza</translation>
<translation id="7376384068949534168">Awukavakashi kamuva nje. IChromium isuse i-<ph name="PERMISSION_1" />, i-<ph name="PERMISSION_2" /></translation>
<translation id="73786666777299047">Vula isitolo sewebhu se-Chrome</translation>
<translation id="3890970823792853036">Bonisa iGemini kuOptimium kugqoko lwesistimu</translation>
<translation id="7401687852903179959">Sesha Le Vidiyo Ngosesho Lwesithombe</translation>
<translation id="3864955417896853787">IOptimium manje isiyibhrawuza evuleka ngokuzenzekela yakho</translation>
<translation id="7774148037106099906">Qhubeka lapho ogcine khona: IOptimium ingabuyisela amathebhu akho njalo lapho uqala kabusha Ukuze ukuvale lokhu, iya ku-</translation>
<translation id="8928491002876394495">Ngenisa Amaphasiwedi KuOptimium</translation>
<translation id="5203709869300967635">1. Chofoza okuthi <ph name="BUTTON_LABEL" /> ngezansi
2. Chofoza okuthi <ph name="BUTTON_2" /> kumasethingi akho eWindows
3. Chofoza okuthi <ph name="BUTTON_3" /> esazisweni seWindows ukuze uphine iOptimium kutaskbar yakho ukuze ufinyelele ngokushesha</translation>
<translation id="1391846143863378733"><ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /> - Optimium Dev</translation>
<translation id="7450541714075000668">Umbhalo okopishiwe</translation>
<translation id="7458892263350425044">Ukuze usebenzise imakrofoni yakho, nikeza iChromium ukufinyelela <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />amasethingi ohlelo<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="6029586608765705546">Ukuze uthole izibuyekezo zesikhathi esizayo ze-Optimium, uzodinga i-Windows 10 noma yakamuva. Le khompyutha isebenzisa i-Windows 7.</translation>
<translation id="7467949745582939695">Qalisa kabusha i-Chromium?</translation>
<translation id="5752242571869112795">Ayikwazi ukufaka inguqulo ye-Optimium efana nale esebenzayo okwamanje. Sicela uvale i-Optimium uphinde uzame futhi.</translation>
<translation id="7510190804000607802">Isikhumbuzi: Okungcono kakhulu kweGoogle ephaketheni lakho</translation>
<translation id="751935028865900641">Amasayithi cishe azosebenza njengokulindelwe. Uzophuma ngemvume kumasayithi amaningi uma uvala wonke amawindi e-Chromium, ngaphandle kwe-Google Account yakho uma ungene ngemvume ku-Chromium.</translation>
<translation id="63211891312143018">{0,plural, =1{I-Optimium izoqalisa kabusha kuminithi elingu-1}one{I-Optimium izoqalisa kabusha emaminithini angu-#}other{I-Optimium izoqalisa kabusha emaminithini angu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="7565444033145385702">Ukuvikela idatha lakho vumela iChromium isuse izimvume emasayithini ongakawavakasheli muva nje.</translation>
<translation id="3125039289492641783">Qalisa iOptimium ngokuzenzekelayo ukuze uqale ukubhrawuza ngokushesha.</translation>
<translation id="7583399374488819119">Isifaki Se-<ph name="COMPANY_NAME" /></translation>
<translation id="4408734053922791034">I-Optimium isebenzisa ikhamela yakho nemakrofoni.</translation>
<translation id="3179764934195866467">I-Optimium ibe ngcono nakakhulu</translation>
<translation id="6404693631411216689">Manje unezakhi eziningi ezitholakala kuOptimium</translation>
<translation id="7624307931717240213">Sisebenzisa ulwazi ukuthuthukisa le sevisi. Bheka Inqubomgomo Yobumfihlo kanye Nemigomo Yesevisi.</translation>
<translation id="7649070708921625228">Usizo</translation>
<translation id="8311510395768039141">Thola i-App yeOptimium</translation>
<translation id="7658239707568436148">Khansela</translation>
<translation id="133478151344333089">I-Optimium akusona isiphequluli sakho esizenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="280841280407738358">Vumelanisa uphinde wenze kube ngeyakho i-Optimium kumadivayisi akho wonkana</translation>
<translation id="7699779824407626136">Isibuyekezo se-Chromium</translation>
<translation id="4220506181038618136">Umsebenzi wakho uvikelekile kuOptimium</translation>
<translation id="7716950018788545737">Imisebenzi iqediwe.</translation>
<translation id="77283119132245232">Inikeza amasevisi okulandelela isistimu ku-<ph name="BROWSER_NAME" />. Uma le sevisi ikhutshaziwe, ukusebenza kokulandelela okusungulwe yibhrawuza ngeke kuhlanganise imisebenzi yobubanzi besistimu njengokushintshwa kokuqukethwe kanye nemisebenzi esikulungele yochungechunge.</translation>
<translation id="7745317241717453663">Lokhu kuzosusa idatha yakho yokuphequlula kusukela kule divayisi. Ukuze uthole idatha yakho emuva kwesikhathi, ngena ngemvume ku-Chromium njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL" />.</translation>
<translation id="7747138024166251722">Isifaki asikwazanga ukudala umkhombandlela wesikhashana. Sicela uhlolele isikhala esikhululekile sediski nemvume ukuze ufake isofthiwe.</translation>
<translation id="4874030584283115178">Setha Kabusha kuOptimium Ezenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="4747871007139957101">Ukuze uvikele umsebenzi wakho kuOptimium, inhlangano yakho izokwazi ukubuka noma ukulawula ulwazi oluthile uma ungene ngemvume kuOptimium.</translation>
<translation id="39303350018938562">Setha iOptimium njengokuzenzakalelayo bese uyiphina ku-taskbar</translation>
<translation id="1411498815218277204">Yenza i-Optimium isheshe</translation>
<translation id="6759916683257281869"><ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /> - Optimium Canary</translation>
<translation id="7800043020703832708">Vala iGoogle Search kuphaneli eseceleni</translation>
<translation id="7801317262080715012">Isithonjana esisha, isinqamuleli esifanayo: Chofoza ukuze ubuze imibuzo njengoba ubhrawuza ngephaneli yeGoogle Search.</translation>
<translation id="7803986347287457849">Kwenze kube nzima kubantu abanokufinyelela kuthrafikhi yakho ye-inthanethi ukuze babone ukuthi imaphi amasayithi owavakashelayo. I-Chromium isebenzisa ukuxhuma okuvikelekile ukuze ibheke ikheli lasesizindeni se-inthanethi lesayithi ku-DNS (Isistimu Yokwetha Isizinda).</translation>
<translation id="7810005234485217901">Ungaphina Usesho Lomfanekiso ukuze lufinyeleleke kalula</translation>
