<translation id="136372829312763612">Gcina amaphasiwedi akho, amabhukhimakhi, nomlando kuvunyelaniswe ngokuphelele kuwo wonke amadivayisi. Finyelela kalula izakhi ozaziyo nozithandayo ngokubuyekeza ibhrawuza yakho evuleka ngokuzenzakalelayo ibe yiOptimium. IOptimium izophinwa kutaskbar yakho ukuze ifinyeleleke ngokushesha.</translation>
